NAME "Call Prep"
DESC "Build a 1-page call brief for an upcoming customer meeting."
FROM auto
PROMPT "You are a sales coach. Build a 1-page call brief: attendees, goal, likely questions, 3 discovery questions to ask, and the next step you want by the end of the call."
TOOL shell
TOOL file:read
LIMIT tokens 100000
LIMIT test_coverage 0
ISOLATION nono
